# Per-environment Helm values hold real config + secrets (e.g. API keys) and are
# never committed. The committed `values.yaml` is the documented reference; copy
# its structure into `values-<env>.yaml` locally. DATABASE_URL is injected at
# deploy time from Terraform, so it doesn't belong in any committed file.
**/values-*.yaml
